        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. This Agreement supersedes all previous Agreements or understandings either written or oral, and contains the entire understanding between the parties on all matters subject to collective bargaining. No amendment, change, or variation hereof shall be valid or binding unless reduced to writing and signed by representatives of the parties duly authorized to do so.",
